  V41RowStoreEncoding, V41RowStoreEncodingSpec, V41SourceRow, V41FixtureRows, V41PublishedEngramShards, V41FixtureCorrespondenceHolds, V41PublishedTransformUnestablished, V41TransformUnfaithful,
  v41_tensor_slice, v41_source_row, v41_encoding_spec_with_slices, v41_encoding_spec_with_geometry, v41_encoding_spec_key,
